<node id="Great Recession">
  <data key="d0">Great Recession</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Great Recession is a period of economic downturn that lasted from December 2007 to June 2009.&lt;SEP&gt;The Great Recession lasted from December 2007 to June 2009, according to economists at the National Bureau of Economic Research.&lt;SEP&gt;The Great Recession was a period of economic downturn in the United States, affecting various economic indicators.&lt;SEP&gt;The Great Recession is a period of economic downturn that lasted from December 2007 to June 2009, characterized by a significant decline in financial conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Great Recession is a period of economic downturn that started in 2007 and ended in 2009.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1907f29be90571f9ffcda4b2841c8e7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1cb33819e4bd6c1d057fa6c3509018f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6380c2e8f0c4e8f8887468340bc0071d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72f7a37181bc78b429ba629dce8fa4a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f090473fd475b5ea69ebf13b4ebb884</data>
  <data key="d4">PH_2016.06.08_Economy-Final.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1779825837</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="U.S. Census Bureau">
  <data key="d0">U.S. Census Bureau</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The U.S. Census Bureau is an organization that provides data on household income and poverty rates.&lt;SEP&gt;The U.S. Census Bureau is the government agency responsible for collecting and reporting data on various demographic and economic indicators.&lt;SEP&gt;The U.S. Census Bureau is a government agency that conducts surveys.&lt;SEP&gt;U.S. Census Bureau is the organization that published the report on income and poverty in the United States.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1907f29be90571f9ffcda4b2841c8e7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1cb33819e4bd6c1d057fa6c3509018f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cc0783f1b88ff1504f1a79dad5f9bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b7d693f1e826e239ac0b4cbf2422f3f</data>
  <data key="d4">PH_2016.06.08_Economy-Final.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1779825840</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pew Research Center">
  <data key="d0">Pew Research Center</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Pew Research Center is a research organization that conducted surveys and reported findings on Latino economic outlook.&lt;SEP&gt;Pew Research Center is a non-profit organization that conducts surveys and publishes research on various social and economic issues.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pew Research Center is a non-profit organization that conducts public opinion research and demographic studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Pew Research Center is a research organization that conducts surveys and publishes reports.&lt;SEP&gt;Pew Research Center is a research organization that conducted surveys on Latino financial optimism.&lt;SEP&gt;Pew Research Center is a research organization that conducts surveys.&lt;SEP&gt;Pew Research Center is the organization that published multiple reports on various topics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1907f29be90571f9ffcda4b2841c8e7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1cb33819e4bd6c1d057fa6c3509018f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cc0783f1b88ff1504f1a79dad5f9bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4685a8d7626394b5ed73ecc6b964ecae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72f7a37181bc78b429ba629dce8fa4a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b7d693f1e826e239ac0b4cbf2422f3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f090473fd475b5ea69ebf13b4ebb884</data>
